                "description": "Evoking a sense of the past, the Pembroke Lever delivers elegant style. With an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for doors 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches thick, it fits standard pre-drilled doors so this Kwikset made PML Leverset is easy to install.  Available in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry.",
                "keywords": "KWI-Pml, Kwikset Pembroke Levers, kwikset Signature Series levers, kwikset 720PML passage Levers, kwikset 730PML privacy Levers, kwikset 740PML keyed entry Levers, kwikset 788PML dummy Levers, levers for doors, Pembroke door lever sets, keyed door Lever locks, Kwikset door locks, Gentle Wave Design Door Levers,"
